SUMMARY:Free Yoga at East Pensacola Heights Clubhouse (Mondays)
DESCRIPTION:Free Yoga at the East Pensacola Heights Clubhouse is a weekly 
 class every Monday from 6-7 PM\, led by a volunteer instructor\, for ages
  18 and up. A trauma-informed Free PTSD Yoga class is also listed at the 
 same time and place. It's free. The paid Breathe Yoga classes at the same
  clubhouse run at other times (Mondays 9 AM\, Thursdays 5:30 PM\, Fridays
  9 AM) and are a separate program.\nPrice: Free\nArea: Pensacola\nTimes: 
